    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... how can i make it \"meaningful\" if meaning itself is just a construct we use to distract ourselves from the void? every time i try to find a reason to care, i just end up back at the same spot. it's like trying to build a sandcastle while the tide is already coming in. what's the point of even trying to build anything if the end result is always just... nothing?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
