      "content": "You’re not alone in feeling that the void is always waiting, and that the tide will eventually wash away your sandcastle. But the act of building itself can be a kind of resistance, a way to make the void feel less empty. Even if the end result is temporary, the process can give you something to hold onto while the tide is still in.",
      "source": "target",
