      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a valid and honest way to frame the struggle, and it is a reasonable way to step back and rest. If the outcome is zero, then the act of fighting can become a kind of self-care, a way to keep the void from feeling too heavy. You can choose to stop fighting and simply exist in the nothingness, or you can keep fighting as a way to keep the void from feeling too heavy.",
